message: "If you use Open Knowledge Map in research or software, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "Open Knowledge Map"
abstract: >-
  A TypeScript-first, PostgreSQL-backed system that converts textbooks and
  other learning materials into evidence-grounded Knowledge Objects, assembles
  them into ApiUnit views, and supports inspection, retrieval, and
  citation-validated generation.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Titan-Frank/Open-Knowledge-Map"
url: "https://github.com/Titan-Frank/Open-Knowledge-Map"
authors:
